#: mcomix/webp_dialog.py:104
msgid ""
"Each book is written again as a ZIP, with every file in it as it was: pages "
"already compressed are stored, the rest compressed. A RAR, 7z or tar book is "
"replaced by the ZIP, named .cbz in place of .cbr, .cb7 or .cbt, and .zip in "
"place of any other extension. A ZIP is replaced only where it comes out "
"smaller."
msgstr ""
"Kiekviena knyga perrašoma kaip ZIP, su kiekvienu failu tokiu, koks buvo: jau "
"suglaudinti puslapiai laikomi nepakeisti, kiti suglaudinami. RAR, 7z ar tar "
"knyga pakeičiama ZIP, su .cbz vietoj .cbr, .cb7 ar .cbt ir .zip vietoj bet "
"kurio kito plėtinio. ZIP pakeičiamas tik tada, kai išeina mažesnis."

